# https://w3id.org/celine-eu#CommitmentMode
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#CommitmentMode> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#CommitmentMode> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#CommitmentMode> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Classification of how a flexibility commitment is activated." .
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#CommitmentMode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/celine-eu> .
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#CommitmentMode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Commitment Mode" .
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#CommitmentMode> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Commitment Mode" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/celine-eu#ConnectionPointIdentifierScheme
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#ConnectionPointIdentifierScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
